    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Sweep the ball's path each step to catch SetGravity zones it moved clean
        past. Unity only samples trigger overlap once per physics step, so a hard
        shot can cross a thin plane without ever registering inside it and no trigger
        fires at all. Only runs on steps where the ball moved further than its own
        width
